    {
      "_id": "6ae9f56f1154a1055518bb9d",
      "title": "유럽의 연금 사회계약이 흔들리며 퍼지는 공포와 분노",
      "message": "<article class=\"nv-text\">\n<p class=\"nv-cover\"><img class=\"nv-cover-img\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/OX2teVqvMno/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"유럽의 연금 사회계약이 흔들리며 퍼지는 공포와 분노\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<div class=\"nv-lead\">\n<p class=\"nv-lead-text\">빠듯한 재정과 고령화가 유럽의 연금 사회계약을 흔든다는 The Wall Street Journal 기사에서 핵심 시사 영단어를 정리합니다. *AI 음성과 이미지를 사용했습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nv-body\">\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">Stretched public finances and a rapidly aging population are threatening this <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">covenant</mark>...</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">빠듯한 국가 재정과 급속한 인구 고령화가 이러한 사회적 약속을 위협하고 있다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. covenant: 사회적 약속, 합의 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">This in turn is driving up <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">sovereign debt</mark> and borrowing costs.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">이는 다시 국가채무와 차입 비용을 끌어올리고 있다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. sovereign debt: 국가채무 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\"><mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">Demographics</mark> is the only science that never lies.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">인구 통계는 결코 거짓말하지 않는 유일한 과학이다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. demographics: 인구 통계, 인구 구조 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">...requiring tens of billions in fresh borrowing for a country whose debt already <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">tops</mark> 117% of GDP.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">이미 국가채무가 GDP의 117%를 넘는 나라에 수백억 규모의 추가 차입을 요구하면서.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. top: 넘다, 초과하다 (동)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">French voters enjoy both one of the world's longest life expectancies and some of its earliest <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">statutory</mark> retirement ages.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">프랑스 유권자들은 세계에서 가장 긴 수준의 기대수명과 가장 이른 편에 속하는 법정 은퇴 연령을 모두 누리고 있다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. statutory: 법으로 정한, 법정의 (형)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">Reaching pension age in the country is widely considered a <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">rite</mark> of passage into a second phase of life...</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">그 나라에서 연금 수급 연령에 도달하는 것은 인생의 두 번째 단계로 들어가는 통과의례로 널리 여겨진다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. rite: 의례, 의식 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"nv-related-links\">\n<p class=\"nv-related-link-line\"><a class=\"nv-related-link nv-related-link--youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OX2teVqvMno\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📺</span> 유튜브 보기</a></p>\n<div class=\"board-comments-root nv-related-comments\" data-board-comments-root></div>\n</footer>\n<footer class=\"nv-source\">\n  <p class=\"nv-source-label\">출처</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-text\">The Wall Street Journal | Panic and Anger Spread as Europe’s Great Pension Covenant Unravels | By Tom Fairless and Noemie Bisserbe | Nov. 1, 2026</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-link-wrap\"><a class=\"nv-source-link\" href=\"https://www.wsj.com/world/europe/panic-and-anger-spread-as-europes-great-pension-covenant-unravels-69a94ed7?mod=hp_trendingnow_article_pos5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">원문 기사 보기</a></p>\n</footer>\n</article>",
