      "_id": "6aeaed5e1154a1055518c184",
      "title": "잦은 이직은 현명한 선택일까?",
      "message": "<article class=\"nv-text\">\n<p class=\"nv-cover\"><img class=\"nv-cover-img\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/pvFPylFeOU0/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"잦은 이직은 현명한 선택일까?\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<div class=\"nv-lead\">\n<p class=\"nv-lead-text\">잦은 이직은 현명한 선택일까? 주제를 다룬 The Wall Street Journal 기사에서 주요 시사 영단어를 정리합니다. *AI 음성과 이미지를 사용했습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nv-body\">\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">The evidence suggests that sticking it out <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">for the long haul</mark> can often give an employee a competitive advantage.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">증거에 따르면, 오랫동안 묵묵히 버티는 것이 직원에게 종종 경쟁 우위를 가져다줄 수 있습니다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. for the long haul: 긴 안목으로 보면, 결국은</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">The longer you are in a job, the more you get to know your colleagues and your managers, building the quality of those working relationships. (<mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">build</mark>)</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">한 직장에 오래 있을수록 동료와 상사를 더 잘 알게 되며, 그러한 업무 관계의 질을 높이게 됩니다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. build: 발전시키다, 강화하다</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">Changing employers makes sense if you don’t enjoy what you’re doing, if you feel underpaid or otherwise <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">underappreciated</mark>...</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">하고 있는 일이 즐겁지 않거나, 보수가 부족하거나 다른 면에서 충분히 인정받지 못한다고 느낀다면 이직하는 것은 합리적입니다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. underappreciated: 충분히 인정받지 못하는</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"nv-related-links\">\n<p class=\"nv-related-link-line\"><a class=\"nv-related-link nv-related-link--youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pvFPylFeOU0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📺</span> 유튜브 보기</a></p>\n<div class=\"board-comments-root nv-related-comments\" data-board-comments-root></div>\n</footer>\n<footer class=\"nv-source\">\n  <p class=\"nv-source-label\">출처</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-text\">The Wall Street Journal | Maybe Job-Hopping Isn’t the Smartest Career Move After All | By Matthew Bidwell</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-link-wrap\"><a class=\"nv-source-link\" href=\"https://www.wsj.com/lifestyle/careers/job-hopping-career-moves-89532b1c\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">원문 기사 보기</a></p>\n</footer>\n</article>",
